cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "landscape-change-detection-pipeline"
abstract: >
  A satellite-imagery land-cover and change-detection pipeline: multi-sensor
  (Landsat 5/7/8/9, Sentinel-2) scene download, per-pixel classification via
  a trained U-Net, monthly composites, and pixel-level breakpoint/change
  detection (CCDC, BFAST, dNBR, NDVI regrowth). The class taxonomy and
  compositing rules are fully swappable, so the same pipeline applies to any
  land-cover or land-surface classification and change-analysis problem.
authors:
